{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Match/Value.html#Lean.Meta.normMatchValue\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">normMatchValue</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns a normal form of the match value `e`, such that two match values denote the same value iff\ntheir normal forms are structurally equal. Distinct `Float`/`Float32` literals can denote the same\nvalue (e.g. `5` and `5.0`), so these are normalized to their bit patterns, consistent with their\n`DecidableEq` instances. Other values are returned unchanged.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Match/Value.html#Lean.Meta.normMatchValue","kind":"def","line":32,"name":"Lean.Meta.normMatchValue","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Match/Value.lean#L32-L43"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Match/Value.html#Lean.Meta.isMatchValue\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">isMatchValue</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Return true is `e` is a term that should be processed by the `match`-compiler using `casesValues`","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Match/Value.html#Lean.Meta.isMatchValue","kind":"def","line":15,"name":"Lean.Meta.isMatchValue","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Match/Value.lean#L15-L30"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.LitValues"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Match.Value"}